## Returns

**`200`** Current area-code coverage. An empty list is a successful coverage read, not an upstream failure. ListNumberAreaCodesResponse

Headers: `Cache-Control`. The raw response carries these headers; see [Raw responses](/api-client/raw-responses).

<ResponseField name="areaCodes" type={"array of string"} required>

